From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 21:55:11 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] [Session] Keep Kodi properties and cookies per session

The service broker held the Kodi properties, cookies, screen info and
manifest tree as process-wide state. A second add-on instance replaced
them with its own, and closing one instance destroyed them under the
other.
